<html>
    <head>
        <title>cuisines</title>
        <style>
            .grid-item1 { grid-area:header;}
            .grid-item2 { grid-area:menu;}
            .grid-item3 { grid-area:main;}
            .grid-item4 { grid-area:footer;}
            .grid-container {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: auto auto auto auto;
                grid-template-areas:
                    'header header header header'
                    'menu main main main'
                    'footer footer footer footer';
                    background-color: lightblue;
                    padding: 20px;
            }
            .grid-container > div {
                background-color: lightgreen;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 20px 0;
                border: 3px solid black;
            }

        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="grid-item1"></div>Burger</div>
            <p>Burger is a popular fast food item.</p>
            <div class="grid-item2"></div>Pizza</div>
             <p>Pizza is a traditional Italian dish.</p>
            <div class="grid-item3"></div>pasta</div>
            <p>pasta is popular fast food dish in all over the world</p>
            <div class="grid-item4"></div>Salad</div>

            <p>Salad is very healthy and tasty</p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>